# NestJS (`apps/api-server`)

- Modular monolith: future code under `src/modules`, `src/agents`, `src/queues`.
- Follow the `nestjs-api` skill for layout and conventions.
- Do not implement LangGraph agents or BullMQ workers until the current phase explicitly includes them.
- Depend on `@travel-bug/db` for schema/types; do not redefine tables in the API app.
